      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The recognition of distinct T- and B-cell lineages provided a foundational framework for adaptive immunity.",
        "attribution": "Miller and Cooper are strongly identified with the respective lineage-defining discoveries.",
        "maturity": "The finding has been deeply confirmed and has organized immunology for decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The broad subsequent elaboration of lymphocyte biology makes the boundary of the credited discovery necessarily selective."
