        "nobel_worthiness": "The unfolded protein response established a central mechanism by which cells sense and respond to endoplasmic-reticulum stress.",
        "attribution": "Mori and Walter provide a compact and credible attribution for the pathway's defining signaling mechanisms.",
        "maturity": "Its core biology is firmly established, with broad relevance to cell physiology and disease.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The breadth of the response includes important contributions beyond the two proposed laureates."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
