        "attribution": "June, Sadelain, and Rosenberg represent major complementary clinical and engineering contributions.",
        "maturity": "Multiple approved therapies and substantial patient benefit support maturity, despite remaining limitations.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Priority and credit extend across a large interdisciplinary field.",
