        "attribution": "Druker, Sawyers, and Lydon plausibly cover key clinical, biological, and drug-development contributions.",
        "maturity": "The therapeutic principle and long-term benefit are firmly demonstrated.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery of BCR-ABL itself and the broader targeted-therapy field complicate a narrow attribution."
        ]
      }
